<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en-US">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="description" content="Ashley Kang 👸🏻">
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Ashley Kang</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/_base.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/style.css">
  </head>
  <body>
      <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="envelope lifted">
          <div class="envelope-back"></div>
          <div class="postcard"></div>
          <div class="letter">
            <header class="letterhead">
              <p class="letterhead-title">From the studio of Ashley Kang</p>
              <p class="date">Fall 2026</p>
            </header>
            <section class="letter-body">
              <p>Hello world! I use my caboodle of design, code, and AI to reinspire us to create and connect 🪄</p>
              <p>My career mixtape is about learning from the best: A season in web development with an award-winning in-house marketing team and a design and technology consulting collective, then a pivot to cybersecurity at an applied AI unicorn and other world-class teams. I have a MS in computer science and a BA in a self-designed liberal arts concentration in art, media studies, and computer science. Now, I'm on a side quest to advise non-technical clients on how to use AI to build their dreams while building my own, such as an advisor that helps early careers and career changers without a network to network.</p>
              <p>Tell me more about full-time and project-based opportunities where I get to use my product mind, security heart, and builder hands. My idea of a good time is a newsletter with a sense of humor, an einspänner, and <em>Some Kind of Wonderful</em> (1987).</p>
              <p>Hope to meet you!</p>
              <ul>
                <li><a href="https://linkedin.com/in/kangashley" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a></li>
                <li>Member @ <a href="https://www.jointheogc.com/" target="_blank">the old girls club</a>, <a href="https://aisnackclub.com/" target="_blank">AI Snack Club</a>, <a href="https://www.wicys.org/" target="_blank">Women in CyberSecurity</a></li>
                <li>Speaker @ <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20251012155320/https://www.tuftswit.com/speakers" target="_blank">Tufts Women in Tech Conference</a>, <a href="https://www.instagram.com/buwics/p/DQpDy3HDg78/" target="_blank">BU Women in Computer Science Club</a></li>
              </ul>
              <p class="signoff">Find what brings you to life,<span class="signature">Ashley</span></p>
              <p class="note">Credits: Designed and developed by yours truly (&#169; 2026 Ashley Kang), layout help from Claude Code, typeset with Cutive Mono and Pinyon Script from Google Fonts, compressed with Squoosh</p>
            </section>
          </div>
          <div class="fold-left"></div>
          <div class="fold-right"></div>
          <div class="fold-bottom"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <script src="js/envelope.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
